n\\\\n[Sign in](/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fanomalyco%2Fopencode%2Fissues%2F9387)\\\\n\\\\n[Sign up](/signup?ref_cta=Sign+up&ref_loc=header+logged+out&ref_page=%2F%3Cuser-name%3E%2F%3Crepo-name%3E%2Fvoltron%2Fissues_fragments%2Fissue_layout&source=header-repo&source_repo=anomalyco%2Fopencode)\\\\n\\\\nAppearance settings\\\\n\\\\nResetting focus\\\\n\\\\nYou signed in with another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You signed out in another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You switched accounts on another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. Dismiss alert\\\\n\\\\n### Uh oh!\\\\n\\\\nThere was an error while loading. Please reload this page.\\\\n\\\\n[anomalyco](/anomalyco) / **[opencode](/anomalyco/opencode)** Public\\\\n\\\\n-   [Notifications](/login?return_to=%2Fanomalyco%2Fopencode) You must be signed in to change notification settings\\\\n-   [Fork 23.1k](/login?return_to=%2Fanomalyco%2Fopencode)\\\\n-   [Star 185k](/login?return_to=%2Fanomalyco%2Fopencode)\\\\n    \\\\n\\\\n-   [Code](/anomalyco/opencode)\\\\n-   [Issues 3.6k](/anomalyco/opencode/issues)\\\\n-   [Pull requests 1.1k](/anomalyco/opencode/pulls)\\\\n-   [Actions](/anomalyco/opencode/actions)\\\\n-   [Projects](/anomalyco/opencode/projects)\\\\n-   [Security and quality 2](/anomalyco/opencode/security)\\\\n-   [Insights](/anomalyco/opencode/pulse)\\\\n\\\\nAdditional navigation options\\\\n\\\\n-   [Code](/anomalyco/opencode)\\\\n-   [Issues](/anomalyco/opencode/issues)\\\\n-   [Pull requests](/anomalyco/opencode/pulls)\\\\n-   [Actions](/anomalyco/opencode/actions)\\\\n-   [Projects](/anomalyco/opencode/projects)\\\\n-   [Security and quality](/anomalyco/opencode/security)\\\\n-   [Insights](/anomalyco/opencode/pulse)\\\\n\\\\n# \\\\\\\\[FEATURE\\\\\\\\]: `opencode session export` to markdown or json #9387\\\\n\\\\nNew issue\\\\n\\\\nCopy link\\\\n\\\\nNew issue\\\\n\\\\nCopy link\\\\n\\\\nOpen\\\\n\\\\n[#32262](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/pull/32262)\\\\n\\\\nOpen\\\\n\\\\n[\\\\\\\\[FEATURE\\\\\\\\]: `opencode session export` to markdown or json](#top)#9387\\\\n\\\\n[#32262](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/pull/32262)\\\\n\\\\nCopy link\\\\n\\\\nAssignees\\\\n\\\\n[![thdxr](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/826656?s=64&u=579a8f3f85f3f921a266d90f01b17a1d4ff59b9e&v=4)](/thdxr)\\\\n\\\\n## Description\\\\n\\\\n[![@paralin](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/534887?u=5fb0344d27728babcd344839ec9d90bf07a3c58f&v=4&size=48)](https://github.com/paralin)\\\\n\\\\n[paralin](https://github.com/paralin)\\\\n\\\\nopened [on Jan 19, 2026](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/9387#issue-3829116103)\\\\n\\\\nIssue body actions\\\\n\\\\n### Feature hasn''''''''t been suggested before.\\\\n\\\\n-    I have verified this feature I''''''''m about to request hasn''''''''t been suggested before.\\\\n\\\\n### Describe the enhancement you want to request\\\\n\\\\nWe need a way to export opencode sessions to Markdown or Json format with a TUI flag.\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\n % opencode session export -h\\\\nopencode session export [sessionID]\\\\n\\\\nexport session transcript to file\\\\n\\\\nPositionals:\\\\n  sessionID  session id to export                                                           [string]\\\\n\\\\nOptions:\\\\n  -h, --help        show help                                                              [boolean]\\\\n  -v, --version     show version number                                                    [boolean]\\\\n      --print-logs  print logs to stderr                                                   [boolean]\\\\n      --log-level   log level                   [string] [choices: \\\\\\\"DEBUG\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"INFO\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"WARN\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ERROR\\\\\\\"]\\\\n      --dir         directory to run in                                                     [string]\\\\n  -o, --output      output file path                                                        [string]\\\\n  -f, --format      output format       [string] [choices: \\\\\\\"markdown\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"json\\\\\\\"] [default: \\\\\\\"markdown\\\\\\\"]\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nReactions are currently unavailable\\\\n\\\\n## Metadata\\\\n\\\\n## Metadata\\\\n\\\\n### Assignees\\\\n\\\\n-   [![@thdxr](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/826656?s=64&u=579a8f3f85f3f921a266d90f01b17a1d4ff59b9e&v=4)\\\\n    \\\\n    thdxr\\\\n    \\\\n    ](/thdxr)\\\\n\\\\n### Labels\\\\n\\\\nNo labels\\\\n\\\\nNo labels\\\\n\\\\n### Type\\\\n\\\\nNo type\\\\n\\\\n### Fields\\\\n\\\\nNo fields configured for issues without a type.\\\\n\\\\n### Projects\\\\n\\\\nNo projects\\\\n\\\\n### Milestone\\\\n\\\\nNo milestone\\\\n\\\\n### Relationships\\\\n\\\\nNone yet\\\\n\\\\n### Development\\\\n\\\\nNo branches or pull requests\\\\n\\\\n## Issue actions\\\\n\\\\n-   ![](https://github.githubassets.com/assets/github-copilot-app-light-7138e992c731a2bb.png)Open in GitHub Copilot app\\\\n\\\\n## Footer\\\\n\\\\n[](https://github.com)© 2026 GitHub, Inc.\\\\n\\\\n### Footer navigation\\\\n\\\\n-   [Terms](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/github-terms/github-terms-of-service)\\\\n-   [Privacy](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement)\\\\n-   [Security](https://github.com/security)\\\\n-   [Status](https://www.githubstatus.com/)\\\\n-   [Community](https://github.community/)\\\\n-   [Docs](https://docs.github.com/)\\\\n-   [Contact](https://support.github.com?tags=dotcom-footer)\\\\n-   Manage cookies\\\\n-   Do not share my personal information\\\\n\\\\nYou can’t perform that action at this time.\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"truncated\\\":false},\\\"title\\\":\\\"https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/9387 (text/html; charset=utf-8)\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1783856715399,\\\"end\\\":1783856718948}}}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f56256466001LdXQl9opWYgGYc'''', ''''msg_f56253dc80012oqL1iT572P7u4'''', ''''ses_0a9dac278ffeGqD1mzTDArbRM0'''', 1783856718950, 1783856718951, ''''{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"tool-calls\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-finish\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"total\\\":9164,\\\"input\\\":8911,\\\"output\\\":201,\\\"reasoning\\\":52,\\\"cache\\\":{\\\"write\\\":0,\\\"read\\\":0}},\\\"cost\\\":0.0052145}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f562568ea001pKwMDhs4djGw5X'''', ''''msg_f5625646b0011Wa2BiGZK1NdmP'''', ''''ses_0a9dac278ffeGqD1mzTDArbRM0'''', 1783856720106, 1783856720107, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f562568ec001eRVgUHLb37NnUj'''', ''''msg_f5625646b0011Wa2BiGZK1NdmP'''', ''''ses_0a9dac278ffeGqD1mzTDArbRM0'''', 1783856720108, 1783856729771, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Now I have all the information I need. Let me analyze the differences between the user''''''''s conversation-backup skill and the three referenced issues.\\\\n\\\\n1. **#27752 - opencode-mempalace-persistence**: A plugin that auto-saves conversations to a local vector database (MemPalace) in real-time. Features: auto-sync every turn, categorization, knowledge graph extraction, async mining. Uses plugin hooks (chat.message, event:session.idle).\\\\n\\\\n2. **#19017 - Save conversation history locally**: A simple feature request asking for local file-based conversation saves. Very basic request, no implementation details.\\\\n\\\\n3. **#9387 - opencode session export to markdown or json**: A feature request for a CLI command to export sessions to markdown or JSON format. Has a PR (#32262) associated. Single-session export, one-way (export only), file-based output.\\\\n\\\\nNow let me compare these with the user''''''''s conversation-backup skill:\\\\n\\\\n**User''''''''s conversation-backup skill:**\\\\n- Exports to SQL format (complete database dump, not just text)\\\\n- Bidirectional: export AND import (cross-device migration)\\\\n- Uses git for version control and sync (conversations-backup branch)\\\\n- Path/project-agnostic with placeholder substitution ({{WORKTREE}}, {{PROJECT_ID}})\\\\n- Cross-device via git remote URL identification\\\\n- Project-scoped (per-project conversations)\\\\n- Uses INSERT OR REPLACE for safe merging\\\\n- Dry-run preview before import\\\\n- Safety: new-session check, excludes current session from export\\\\n- No external dependencies (Node.js 22+ built-in sqlite)\\\\n- Operates on dedicated git branch to avoid polluting work branch\\\\n\\\\nKey differentiators:\\\\n1. **vs #27752 (MemPalace)**: MemPalace is a vector DB for semantic search/retrieval - it''''''''s about making conversations searchable and usable by AI. The user''''''''s skill is about exact-fidelity backup and cross-device migration. Different use cases entirely.\\\\n2. **vs #19017**: That''''''''s just a wish for local saves - the user''''''''s skill is a complete implementation with git-based sync.\\\\n3. **vs #9387**: Export to markdown/json is one-way, single-session, human-readable format. The user''''''''s skill does full SQL database dump (all tables), bidirectional (export+import), multi-session, and is designed for cross-device migration rather than human reading.\\\\n\\\\nLet me summarize the key differences and advantages.\\\\n\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1783856720108,\\\"end\\\":1783856729770}}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f56258eac0019AmmgS4IeGF8ye'''', ''''msg_f5625646b0011Wa2BiGZK1NdmP'''', ''''ses_0a9dac278ffeGqD1mzTDArbRM0'''', 1783856729772, 1783856741326, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"以下是你的 conversation-backup skill 与三个竞品的对比分析：\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 对比总结\\\\n\\\\n| 维度 | 你的 skill | #27752 MemPalace | #19017 本地保存 | #9387 导出 md/json |\\\\n|---|---|---|---|---|\\\\n| **核心定位** | 跨设备对话迁移 | 向量数据库语义检索 | 纯诉求，无实现 | 单会话只读导出 |\\\\n| **方向** | 双向（导出+导入） | 单向（写入向量库） | 未定义 | 单向（仅导出） |\\\\n| **格式** | SQL 完整数据库转储 | 向量嵌入 | 未定义 | Markdown/JSON 文本 |\\\\n| **同步方式** | Git 版本控制 | 本地实时同步 | 未定义 | 手动 CLI 命令 |\\\\n| **跨设备** | 原生支持（git remote 识别） | 不支持 | 不支持 | 不支持 |\\\\n| **数据完整性** | 全表级（sessions/messages 等所有表） | 仅提取的知识图谱事实 | 未定义 | 单会话文本 |\\\\n| **路径适配** | 占位符自动替换（{{WORKTREE}}） | 无此需求 | 未定义 | 无此需求 |\\\\n| **安全性** | 新会话检查、排除当前会话、dry-run 预览、独立分支 | 无 | 无 | 无 |\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 你的核心差异化优势\\\\n\\\\n1. **唯一解决跨设备迁移问题** — 其他三个都是单设备场景，你的 skill 是唯一通过 git 实现多设备间对话完整迁移的方案\\\\n\\\\n2. **全量数据库级备份 vs 文本/向量级** — SQL 导出保留了完整的数据库结构和关系，导入后可直接恢复使用，而非仅用于人类阅读（md/json）或语义搜索（向量库）\\\\n\\\\n3. **双向闭环** — 导出+导入+dry-run 预览+确认机制，形成完整的备份恢复工作流，其他方案都是单向的\\\\n\\\\n4. **零依赖** — 利用 Node.js 22+ 内置 `node:sqlite`，无需 npm install，无外部服务依赖（MemPalace 需要额外的向量数据库）\\\\n\\\\n5. **Git 原生集成** — 对话备份跟随代码仓库一起版本管理，自带变更历史和协作能力，独立分支不污染工作区\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 建议回复维护者的差异化说明\\\\n\\\\n你可以这样回复：\\\\n\\\\n> Unlike #27752 (vector DB for semantic search), #19017 (local save wish), and #9387 (single-session text export), this skill solves a distinct problem: **cross-device conversation migration** with full database fidelity. It provides bidirectional SQL export/import via git, with path-agnostic placeholder substitution, dry-run preview, and zero external dependencies. The existing issues focus on single-device persistence or human-readable export — none address moving complete conversation state between machines.\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1783856729772,\\\"end\\\":1783856741325}}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f5625bbd0001JZq23xUwU8CHax'''', ''''msg_f5625646b0011Wa2BiGZK1NdmP'''', ''''ses_0a9dac278ffeGqD1mzTDArbRM0'''', 1783856741328, 1783856741328, ''''{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"stop\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-finish\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"total\\\":20742,\\\"input\\\":11118,\\\"output\\\":645,\\\"reasoning\\\":531,\\\"cache\\\":{\\\"write\\\":0,\\\"read\\\":8448}},\\\"cost\\\":0.0095094}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f56044a9800243PE06oEQk27TD'''', ''''msg_f56044a98001BwlDRHaUHyaiOM'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854549690, 1783854549698, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"我要把这个skill开源到github，帮我取一个合适的项目名称\\\"}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f5604509e001j8aQhBBAC8pRXX'''', ''''msg_f56044ad5001NAzc6Qd90KWIqV'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854551198, 1783854551199, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-s