aZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854553442, 1783854553443, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f56045964001thEb5YH1DGpRol'''', ''''msg_f5604567b001DUFI5Vj6oyMzYl'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854553444, 1783854553898, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Let me read the SKILL.md to understand what this skill does before suggesting a name.\\\\n\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1783854553444,\\\"end\\\":1783854553896}}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f56045b2c001w6ejuKiqPsJMHu'''', ''''msg_f5604567b001DUFI5Vj6oyMzYl'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854553900, 1783854554648, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"callID\\\":\\\"call_109f7c1f5ec64e25814deab7\\\",\\\"state\\\":{\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"filePath\\\":\\\"{{WORKTREE}}\\\\\\\\SKILL.md\\\"},\\\"output\\\":\\\"<path>{{WORKTREE}}\\\\\\\\SKILL.md</path>\\\\n<type>file</type>\\\\n<content>\\\\n1: ---\\\\n2: name: conversation-backup\\\\n3: description: 当用户提到\\\\\\\"对话备份\\\\\\\"时导出当前项目的 opencode 对话记录为 SQL 文件并提交推送到远程仓库；当用户提到\\\\\\\"对话导入\\\\\\\"时从 SQL 文件导入对话记录到本地 opencode 数据库。\\\\n4: ---\\\\n5: \\\\n6: # 对话备份与导入\\\\n7: \\\\n8: 本 skill 用于在不同设备间迁移 opencode 对话记录。对话数据导出为 SQL 文件，跟随项目代码一起通过 git 管理。\\\\n9: \\\\n10: ## 脚本路径说明\\\\n11: \\\\n12: 本 skill 的脚本位于 SKILL.md 同级 `scripts/` 目录下，执行时需使用绝对路径：\\\\n13: \\\\n14: ```\\\\n15: C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/\\\\n16: ```\\\\n17: \\\\n18: ## 前置检查（必须首先执行）\\\\n19: \\\\n20: **无论用户说\\\\\\\"对话备份\\\\\\\"还是\\\\\\\"对话导入\\\\\\\"，都必须先执行以下检查：**\\\\n21: \\\\n22: 1. 运行检查脚本：\\\\n23: \\\\n24: ```bash\\\\n25: node C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/check_session.js\\\\n26: ```\\\\n27: \\\\n28: 2. 检查输出的 JSON：\\\\n29:    - 如果 `is_new_session: false`：**终止流程**，告诉用户：「对话备份/导入必须在新的对话中执行，当前对话已有历史记录，请新建一个对话后再执行此操作。」\\\\n30:    - 如果 `is_new_session: true`：继续执行后续流程\\\\n31: \\\\n32: 3. 记录输出中的 `session_id`，后续步骤需要用到\\\\n33: \\\\n34: ## 对话备份\\\\n35: \\\\n36: 当前置检查通过后，执行以下步骤：\\\\n37: \\\\n38: 1. 记录当前分支，拉取远程变更，然后切换到 `conversations-backup` 分支：\\\\n39: \\\\n40: ```bash\\\\n41: ORIGINAL_BRANCH=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD)\\\\n42: git fetch origin\\\\n43: git checkout conversations-backup 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b conversations-backup origin/main\\\\n44: ```\\\\n45: \\\\n46: 2. 运行导出脚本，排除当前对话（将 `<项目目录>` 替换为当前项目的绝对路径，`<session_id>` 替换为前置检查中获取的当前对话 ID）：\\\\n47: \\\\n48: ```bash\\\\n49: node C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/export_conversations.js --exclude-session <session_id> \\\\\\\"<项目目录>\\\\\\\"\\\\n50: ```\\\\n51: \\\\n52: 3. 检查输出的 JSON，确认 `success: true` 并查看各表导出的记录数\\\\n53: 4. 使用输出中的 `commit_message` 字段作为 git commit message，**必须完整使用，不得截断或省略任何内容**（包括各对话详情列表）：\\\\n54: \\\\n55: ```bash\\\\n56: git add .opencode/conversations.sql\\\\n57: git commit -m \\\\\\\"使用 commit_message 字段的内容\\\\\\\"\\\\n58: git push origin conversations-backup\\\\n59: ```\\\\n60: \\\\n61: 5. 切回用户原来的分支：\\\\n62: \\\\n63: ```bash\\\\n64: git checkout $ORIGINAL_BRANCH\\\\n65: ```\\\\n66: \\\\n67: 6. 向用户报告导出结果（各表记录数）\\\\n68: \\\\n69: ## 对话导入\\\\n70: \\\\n71: 当前置检查通过后，执行以下步骤：\\\\n72: \\\\n73: 1. 记录当前分支，拉取远程变更，然后切换到 `conversations-backup` 分支：\\\\n74: \\\\n75: ```bash\\\\n76: ORIGINAL_BRANCH=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD)\\\\n77: git fetch origin\\\\n78: git checkout conversations-backup 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b conversations-backup origin/main\\\\n79: ```\\\\n80: \\\\n81: 2. 先运行 dry-run 预览：\\\\n82: \\\\n83: ```bash\\\\n84: node C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/import_conversations.js --dry-run \\\\\\\"<项目目录>\\\\\\\"\\\\n85: ```\\\\n86: \\\\n87: 3. 将预览结果展示给用户，包括：\\\\n88:    - 各表将要导入的记录数\\\\n89:    - 本地项目路径和 project_id\\\\n90:    - SQL 文件头部元信息\\\\n91: \\\\n92: 4. 使用 `question` 工具询问用户是否确认导入，说明导入将使用 `INSERT OR REPLACE` 覆盖同主键的已有记录\\\\n93: \\\\n94: 5. 用户确认后执行实际导入：\\\\n95: \\\\n96: ```bash\\\\n97: node C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/import_conversations.js --yes \\\\\\\"<项目目录>\\\\\\\"\\\\n98: ```\\\\n99: \\\\n100: 6. 切回用户原来的分支：\\\\n101: \\\\n102: ```bash\\\\n103: git checkout $ORIGINAL_BRANCH\\\\n104: ```\\\\n105: \\\\n106: 7. 向用户报告导入结果\\\\n107: \\\\n108: ## 注意事项\\\\n109: \\\\n110: - SQL 文件中的项目绝对路径和 project_id 使用 `{{WORKTREE}}` 和 `{{PROJECT_ID}}` 占位符，导入时自动替换为当前设备的实际值\\\\n111: - 跨设备识别通过 git remote URL 确认是同一个项目\\\\n112: - 导入使用 `INSERT OR REPLACE`，主键相同的记录会被覆盖，不影响其他项目的对话\\\\n113: - 脚本依赖 Node.js 22+（使用内置 `node:sqlite` 模块，无需 npm install）\\\\n114: - **对话备份/导入必须在新的对话中执行**，避免将执行过程本身的数据导出\\\\n115: - 备份/导入操作在独立的 `conversations-backup` 分支上执行，避免 commit 记录污染用户的工作分支；操作完成后自动切回原分支\\\\n\\\\n(End of file - total 115 lines)\\\\n</content>\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"preview\\\":\\\"---\\\\nname: conversation-backup\\\\ndescription: 当用户提到\\\\\\\"对话备份\\\\\\\"时导出当前项目的 opencode 对话记录为 SQL 文件并提交推送到远程仓库；当用户提到\\\\\\\"对话导入\\\\\\\"时从 SQL 文件导入对话记录到本地 opencode 数据库。\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n# 对话备份与导入\\\\n\\\\n本 skill 用于在不同设备间迁移 opencode 对话记录。对话数据导出为 SQL 文件，跟随项目代码一起通过 git 管理。\\\\n\\\\n## 脚本路径说明\\\\n\\\\n本 skill 的脚本位于 SKILL.md 同级 `scripts/` 目录下，执行时需使用绝对路径：\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\nC:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## 前置检查（必须首先执行）\\\\n\\\\n**无论用户说\\\\\\\"对话备份\\\\\\\"还是\\\\\\\"对话导入\\\\\\\"，都必须先执行以下检查：**\\\",\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"loaded\\\":[],\\\"display\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"file\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"{{WORKTREE}}\\\\\\\\SKILL.md\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"---\\\\nname: conversation-backup\\\\ndescription: 当用户提到\\\\\\\"对话备份\\\\\\\"时导出当前项目的 opencode 对话记录为 SQL 文件并提交推送到远程仓库；当用户提到\\\\\\\"对话导入\\\\\\\"时从 SQL 文件导入对话记录到本地 opencode 数据库。\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n# 对话备份与导入\\\\n\\\\n本 skill 用于在不同设备间迁移 opencode 对话记录。对话数据导出为 SQL 文件，跟随项目代码一起通过 git 管理。\\\\n\\\\n## 脚本路径说明\\\\n\\\\n本 skill 的脚本位于 SKILL.md 同级 `scripts/` 目录下，执行时需使用绝对路径：\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\nC:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## 前置检查（必须首先执行）\\\\n\\\\n**无论用户说\\\\\\\"对话备份\\\\\\\"还是\\\\\\\"对话导入\\\\\\\"，都必须先执行以下检查：**\\\\n\\\\n1. 运行检查脚本：\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nnode C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/check_session.js\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n2. 检查输出的 JSON：\\\\n   - 如果 `is_new_session: false`：**终止流程**，告诉用户：「对话备份/导入必须在新的对话中执行，当前对话已有历史记录，请新建一个对话后再执行此操作。」\\\\n   - 如果 `is_new_session: true`：继续执行后续流程\\\\n\\\\n3. 记录输出中的 `session_id`，后续步骤需要用到\\\\n\\\\n## 对话备份\\\\n\\\\n当前置检查通过后，执行以下步骤：\\\\n\\\\n1. 记录当前分支，拉取远程变更，然后切换到 `conversations-backup` 分支：\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nORIGINAL_BRANCH=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD)\\\\ngit fetch origin\\\\ngit checkout conversations-backup 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b conversations-backup origin/main\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n2. 运行导出脚本，排除当前对话（将 `<项目目录>` 替换为当前项目的绝对路径，`<session_id>` 替换为前置检查中获取的当前对话 ID）：\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nnode C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/export_conversations.js --exclude-session <session_id> \\\\\\\"<项目目录>\\\\\\\"\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n3. 检查输出的 JSON，确认 `success: true` 并查看各表导出的记录数\\\\n4. 使用输出中的 `commit_message` 字段作为 git commit message，**必须完整使用，不得截断或省略任何内容**（包括各对话详情列表）：\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\ngit add .opencode/conversations.sql\\\\ngit commit -m \\\\\\\"使用 commit_message 字段的内容\\\\\\\"\\\\ngit push origin conversations-backup\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n5. 切回用户原来的分支：\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\ngit checkout $ORIGINAL_BRANCH\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n6. 向用户报告导出结果（各表记录数）\\\\n\\\\n## 对话导入\\\\n\\\\n当前置检查通过后，执行以下步骤：\\\\n\\\\n1. 记录当前分支，拉取远程变更，然后切换到 `conversations-backup` 分支：\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nORIGINAL_BRANCH=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD)\\\\ngit fetch origin\\\\ngit checkout conversations-backup 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b conversations-backup origin/main\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n2. 先运行 dry-run 预览：\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nnode C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/import_conversations.js --dry-run \\\\\\\"<项目目录>\\\\\\\"\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n3. 将预览结果展示给用户，包括：\\\\n   - 各表将要导入的记录数\\\\n   - 本地项目路径和 project_id\\\\n   - SQL 文件头部元信息\\\\n\\\\n4. 使用 `question` 工具询问用户是否确认导入，说明导入将使用 `INSERT OR REPLACE` 覆盖同主键的已有记录\\\\n\\\\n5. 用户确认后执行实际导入：\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nnode C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/import_conversations.js --yes \\\\\\\"<项目目录>\\\\\\\"\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n6. 切回用户原来的分支：\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\ngit checkout $ORIGINAL_BRANCH\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n7. 向用户报告导入结果\\\\n\\\\n## 注意事项\\\\n\\\\n- SQL 文件中的项目绝对路径和 project_id 使用 `{{WORKTREE}}` 和 `{{PROJECT_ID}}` 占位符，导入时自动替换为当前设备的实际值\\\\n- 跨设备识别通过 git remote URL 确认是同一个项目\\\\n- 导入使用 `INSERT OR REPLACE`，主键相同的记录会被覆盖，不影响其他项目的对话\\\\n- 脚本依赖 Node.js 22+（使用内置 `node:sqlite` 模块，无需 npm install）\\\\n- **对话备份/导入必须在新的对话中执行**，避免将执行过程本身的数据导出\\\\n- 备份/导入操作在独立的 `conversations-backup` 分支上执行，避免 commit 记录污染用户的工作分支；操作完成后自动切回原分支\\\",\\\"lineStart\\\":1,\\\"lineEnd\\\":115,\\\"totalLines\\\":115,\\\"truncated\\\":false}},\\\"title\\\":\\\"BaiduSyncdisk\\\\\\\\all_code\\\\\\\\candywall-skills\\\\\\\\conversation-backup\\\\\\\\SKILL.md\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1783854554630,\\\"end\\\":1783854554648}}}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f56045e1a001LKWVaqG0LA6AuD'''', ''''msg_f5604567b001DUFI5Vj6oyMzYl'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854554650, 1783854554651, ''''{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"tool-calls\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-finish\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"total\\\":8970,\\\"input\\\":453,\\\"output\\\":51,\\\"reasoning\\\":18,\\\"cache\\\":{\\\"write\\\":0,\\\"read\\\":8448}},\\\"cost\\\":0.0008559}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f56046537001QrPFZBQ3khDaD5'''', ''''msg_f56045e2100116pqRNYls9AiRO'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854556471, 1783854556472, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f560465390016rgJRMZck0nuvY'''', ''''msg_f56045e2100116pqRNYls9AiRO'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854556473, 1783854562848, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Now I understand what this skill does. It''''''''s an opencode skill for backing up and importing conversation records between devices. The conversation data is exported as SQL files and managed via git.\\\\n\\\\nLet me think of some good project names for open-sourcing this:\\\\n\\\\nKey aspects:\\\\n- It''''''''s for opencode (the CLI tool)\\\\n- It backs up/exports and imports conversation history\\\\n- It uses git for sync across devices\\\\n- It''''''''s a \\\\\\\"skill\\\\\\\" for opencode\\\\n\\\\nName ideas:\\\\n1. `opencode-conversation-backup` - descriptive but long\\\\n2. `opencode-sync` - concise, implies syncing conversations\\\\n3. `opencode-backup` - simple\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n4. `oc-conversation-backup` - abbreviated\\\\n5. `opencode-migrate` - implies migration\\\\n6. `opencode-history-sync` - descriptive\\\\n\\\\nSince this is an opencode skill, I should follow the naming convention of similar skills like `find-skills` and `skill-creator`. I''''''''m leaning toward `opencode-conversation-backup` for clarity, though `opencode-sync` is more concise and captures the cross-device sync aspect better.\\\\n\\\\nLooking at this more carefully, it''''''''s really functioning as both a backup and import tool, so I''''''''m considering names like `opencode-conversation-sync` to emphasize the bidirectional nature, or `opencode-history-backup` to be more explicit about what''''''''s being managed. The shortest option, `opencode-sync`, is appealing but might be too vague. I think I''''''''ll go with `opencode-conversation-sync` as the strongest choice—it''''''''s clear, concise, and accurately reflects the two-way functionality.\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1783854556473,\\\"end\\\":1783854562847}}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f56047e21001HlHHB7qeRmnu1l'''', ''''msg_f56045e2100116pqRNYls9AiRO'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854562849, 1783854565367, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"几个建议，按推荐顺序：\\\\n\\\\n| 名称 | 理由 |\\\\n|------|------|\\\\n| **opencode-conversation-sync** | 准确描述核心功能（跨设备同步对话），简洁易记 |\\\\n| **opencode-history-backup** | 强调\\\\\\\"历史记录备份\\\\\\\"，语义直观 |\\\\n| **opencode-sync** | 最短，但含义偏泛 |\\\\n| **oc-conversation-backup** | 保留原名辨识度，`oc` 前缀表明是 opencode 生态 |\\\\n\\\\n推荐 **`opencode-conversation-sync`** — 既体现了备份又体现了导入（双向同步），且符合 opencode 生态命名风格。\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1783854562849,\\\"end\\\":1783854565366}}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f560487f9001yn0PI3ofWb0yrX'''', ''''msg_f56045e2100116pqRNYls9AiRO'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854565369, 1783854565369, ''''{\\\"reason\\\":\\\"stop\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-finish\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"total\\\":10973,\\\"input\\\":2032,\\\"output\\\":147,\\\"reasoning\\\":346,\\\"cache\\\":{\\\"write\\\":0,\\\"read\\\":8448}},\\\"cost\\\":0.0029174}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f560ae71600152NoHiiA2gfFyN'''', ''''msg_f560ae715001AA1iINgzU8tGnD'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854982956, 1783854982957, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"推送到git@github.com:TangGuoNiuBi/opencode-conversation-sync.git\\\"}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f560aec6a001DYEXWPTSXZDQlj'''', ''''msg_f560ae73f001rYDf6X1GHLZa1L'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854984298, 1783854984299, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f560aec6c001fB2MNczrjoJkw2'''', ''''msg_f560ae73f001rYDf6X1GHLZa1L'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854984300, 1783854985065, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The user wants to push this skill to a GitHub repository. Let me first check the git status of the current directory, then set up the remote and push.\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1783854984300,\\\"end\\\":1783854985064}}''''),\\n-(''''prt_f560aef6a001LCaIQTjcFZLzLS'''', ''''msg_f560ae73f001rYDf6X1GHLZa1L'''', ''''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'''', 1783854985066, 1783854986129, ''''{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"callID\\\":\\\"call_4c1590566f6143d083c55b76\\\",\\\"state\\\":{\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"git status\\\",\\\"workdir\\\":\\\"{{WORKTREE}}\\\"},\\\"output\\\":\\\"fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git\\\\n\\\",\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"output\\\":\\\"fatal: not a 