anomalyco](/anomalyco) / **[opencode](/anomalyco/opencode)** Public\\n\\n-   [Notifications](/login?return_to=%2Fanomalyco%2Fopencode) You must be signed in to change notification settings\\n-   [Fork 23.1k](/login?return_to=%2Fanomalyco%2Fopencode)\\n-   [Star 185k](/login?return_to=%2Fanomalyco%2Fopencode)\\n    \\n\\n-   [Code](/anomalyco/opencode)\\n-   [Issues 3.6k](/anomalyco/opencode/issues)\\n-   [Pull requests 1.1k](/anomalyco/opencode/pulls)\\n-   [Actions](/anomalyco/opencode/actions)\\n-   [Projects](/anomalyco/opencode/projects)\\n-   [Security and quality 2](/anomalyco/opencode/security)\\n-   [Insights](/anomalyco/opencode/pulse)\\n\\nAdditional navigation options\\n\\n-   [Code](/anomalyco/opencode)\\n-   [Issues](/anomalyco/opencode/issues)\\n-   [Pull requests](/anomalyco/opencode/pulls)\\n-   [Actions](/anomalyco/opencode/actions)\\n-   [Projects](/anomalyco/opencode/projects)\\n-   [Security and quality](/anomalyco/opencode/security)\\n-   [Insights](/anomalyco/opencode/pulse)\\n\\n# \\\\[FEATURE\\\\]: Plugin showcase: opencode-mempalace-persistence — auto-save conversations to MemPalace #27752\\n\\nNew issue\\n\\nCopy link\\n\\nNew issue\\n\\nCopy link\\n\\nOpen\\n\\nOpen\\n\\n[\\\\[FEATURE\\\\]: Plugin showcase: opencode-mempalace-persistence — auto-save conversations to MemPalace](#top)#27752\\n\\nCopy link\\n\\nAssignees\\n\\n[![kitlangton](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7587245?s=64&u=e58fa6a5c0a44701814bd4853180d234a74e5a67&v=4)](/kitlangton)\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n[![@geco](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056852?v=4&size=48)](https://github.com/geco)\\n\\n[geco](https://github.com/geco)\\n\\nopened [on May 15, 2026](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/27752#issue-4454733494)\\n\\nIssue body actions\\n\\n### Feature hasn''''t been suggested before.\\n\\n-    I have verified this feature I''''m about to request hasn''''t been suggested before.\\n\\n### Describe the enhancement you want to request\\n\\nI built a plugin that automatically saves every OpenCode conversation to MemPalace (a local vector database) in real-time.\\n\\nFeatures:\\n\\n-   Auto-sync every conversation turn after each response\\n-   Categorizes by type: developer, creative, emotions, family, consciousness\\n-   Extracts Knowledge Graph facts: decisions, milestones, problems, preferences\\n-   Async mining — never blocks the UI\\n-   Pure TypeScript, ~250 lines, no external scripts\\n\\nUses these hooks:\\n\\n-   chat.message (triggers sync when user sends a new message)\\n-   event: session.idle (catches the last turn before shutdown)\\n\\nSetup:\\n\\n1.  Add \\\"opencode-mempalace-persistence\\\" to plugin in opencode.json\\n2.  Create AGENTS.md telling the model to search MemPalace via MCP\\n3.  Add identity to ~/.mempalace/identity.txt\\n\\nRepo: [https://github.com/geco/opencode-mempalace-persistence](https://github.com/geco/opencode-mempalace-persistence)  \\nnpm: opencode-mempalace-persistence\\n\\nHappy to hear feedback!\\n\\nReactions are currently unavailable\\n\\n## Metadata\\n\\n## Metadata\\n\\n### Assignees\\n\\n-   [![@kitlangton](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7587245?s=64&u=e58fa6a5c0a44701814bd4853180d234a74e5a67&v=4)\\n    \\n    kitlangton\\n    \\n    ](/kitlangton)\\n\\n### Labels\\n\\nNo labels\\n\\nNo labels\\n\\n### Type\\n\\nNo type\\n\\n### Fields\\n\\nNo fields configured for issues without a type.\\n\\n### Projects\\n\\nNo projects\\n\\n### Milestone\\n\\nNo milestone\\n\\n### Relationships\\n\\nNone yet\\n\\n### Development\\n\\nNo branches or pull requests\\n\\n## Issue actions\\n\\n-   ![](https://github.githubassets.com/assets/github-copilot-app-light-7138e992c731a2bb.png)Open in GitHub Copilot app\\n\\n## Footer\\n\\n[](https://github.com)© 2026 GitHub, Inc.\\n\\n### Footer navigation\\n\\n-   [Terms](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/github-terms/github-terms-of-service)\\n-   [Privacy](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement)\\n-   [Security](https://github.com/security)\\n-   [Status](https://www.githubstatus.com/)\\n-   [Community](https://github.community/)\\n-   [Docs](https://docs.github.com/)\\n-   [Contact](https://support.github.com?tags=dotcom-footer)\\n-   Manage cookies\\n-   Do not share my personal information\\n\\nYou can’t perform that action at this time.\",\"metadata\":{\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/27752 (text/html; charset=utf-8)\",\"time\":{\"start\":1783856713604,\"end\":1783856716542}}}''),\n-(''prt_f562550140010vSxWImCTRUahh'', ''msg_f56253dc80012oqL1iT572P7u4'', ''ses_0a9dac278ffeGqD1mzTDArbRM0'', 1783856713748, 1783856715932, ''{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"webfetch\",\"callID\":\"call_339bbafafbe547519c99efb5\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"url\":\"https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/19017\",\"format\":\"markdown\"},\"output\":\"                           \\\\[FEATURE\\\\]:Save conversation history locally · Issue #19017 · anomalyco/opencode · GitHub                                              \\n\\n[Skip to content](#start-of-content)  \\n\\n## Navigation Menu\\n\\nToggle navigation\\n\\n[](/)\\n\\n[Sign in](/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fanomalyco%2Fopencode%2Fissues%2F19017)\\n\\nAppearance settings\\n\\n \\n\\n-   Platform\\n    \\n    -   AI CODE CREATION\\n        \\n        -   [\\n            \\n            GitHub CopilotWrite better code with AI\\n            \\n            ](https://github.com/features/copilot)\\n        -   [\\n            \\n            GitHub Copilot appDirect agents from issue to merge\\n            \\n            ](https://github.com/features/ai/github-app)\\n        -   [\\n            \\n            MCP RegistryNewIntegrate external tools\\n            \\n            ](https://github.com/mcp)\\n        \\n    -   DEVELOPER WORKFLOWS\\n        \\n        -   [\\n            \\n            ActionsAutomate any workflow\\n            \\n