-   [Insights](/anomalyco/opencode/pulse)\\n\\nAdditional navigation options\\n\\n-   [Code](/anomalyco/opencode)\\n-   [Issues](/anomalyco/opencode/issues)\\n-   [Pull requests](/anomalyco/opencode/pulls)\\n-   [Actions](/anomalyco/opencode/actions)\\n-   [Projects](/anomalyco/opencode/projects)\\n-   [Security and quality](/anomalyco/opencode/security)\\n-   [Insights](/anomalyco/opencode/pulse)\\n\\n# \\\\[FEATURE\\\\]: `opencode session export` to markdown or json #9387\\n\\nNew issue\\n\\nCopy link\\n\\nNew issue\\n\\nCopy link\\n\\nOpen\\n\\n[#32262](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/pull/32262)\\n\\nOpen\\n\\n[\\\\[FEATURE\\\\]: `opencode session export` to markdown or json](#top)#9387\\n\\n[#32262](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/pull/32262)\\n\\nCopy link\\n\\nAssignees\\n\\n[![thdxr](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/826656?s=64&u=579a8f3f85f3f921a266d90f01b17a1d4ff59b9e&v=4)](/thdxr)\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n[![@paralin](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/534887?u=5fb0344d27728babcd344839ec9d90bf07a3c58f&v=4&size=48)](https://github.com/paralin)\\n\\n[paralin](https://github.com/paralin)\\n\\nopened [on Jan 19, 2026](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/9387#issue-3829116103)\\n\\nIssue body actions\\n\\n### Feature hasn''''t been suggested before.\\n\\n-    I have verified this feature I''''m about to request hasn''''t been suggested before.\\n\\n### Describe the enhancement you want to request\\n\\nWe need a way to export opencode sessions to Markdown or Json format with a TUI flag.\\n\\n```\\n % opencode session export -h\\nopencode session export [sessionID]\\n\\nexport session transcript to file\\n\\nPositionals:\\n  sessionID  session id to export                                                           [string]\\n\\nOptions:\\n  -h, --help        show help                                                              [boolean]\\n  -v, --version     show version number                                                    [boolean]\\n      --print-logs  print logs to stderr                                                   [boolean]\\n      --log-level   log level                   [string] [choices: \\\"DEBUG\\\", \\\"INFO\\\", \\\"WARN\\\", \\\"ERROR\\\"]\\n      --dir         directory to run in                                                     [string]\\n  -o, --output      output file path                                                        [string]\\n  -f, --format      output format       [string] [choices: \\\"markdown\\\", \\\"json\\\"] [default: \\\"markdown\\\"]\\n```\\n\\nReactions are currently unavailable\\n\\n## Metadata\\n\\n## Metadata\\n\\n### Assignees\\n\\n-   [![@thdxr](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/826656?s=64&u=579a8f3f85f3f921a266d90f01b17a1d4ff59b9e&v=4)\\n    \\n    thdxr\\n    \\n    ](/thdxr)\\n\\n### Labels\\n\\nNo labels\\n\\nNo labels\\n\\n### Type\\n\\nNo type\\n\\n### Fields\\n\\nNo fields configured for issues without a type.\\n\\n### Projects\\n\\nNo projects\\n\\n### Milestone\\n\\nNo milestone\\n\\n### Relationships\\n\\nNone yet\\n\\n### Development\\n\\nNo branches or pull requests\\n\\n## Issue actions\\n\\n-   ![](https://github.githubassets.com/assets/github-copilot-app-light-7138e992c731a2bb.png)Open in GitHub Copilot app\\n\\n## Footer\\n\\n[](https://github.com)© 2026 GitHub, Inc.\\n\\n### Footer navigation\\n\\n-   [Terms](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/github-terms/github-terms-of-service)\\n-   [Privacy](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement)\\n-   [Security](https://github.com/security)\\n-   [Status](https://www.githubstatus.com/)\\n-   [Community](https://github.community/)\\n-   [Docs](https://docs.github.com/)\\n-   [Contact](https://support.github.com?tags=dotcom-footer)\\n-   Manage cookies\\n-   Do not share my personal information\\n\\nYou can’t perform that action at this time.\",\"metadata\":{\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/9387 (text/html; charset=utf-8)\",\"time\":{\"start\":1783856715399,\"end\":1783856718948}}}''),\n-(''prt_f56256466001LdXQl9opWYgGYc'', ''msg_f56253dc80012oqL1iT572P7u4'', ''ses_0a9dac278ffeGqD1mzTDArbRM0'', 1783856718950, 1783856718951, ''{\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":9164,\"input\":8911,\"output\":201,\"reasoning\":52,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0.0052145}''),\n-(''prt_f562568ea001pKwMDhs4djGw5X'', ''msg_f5625646b0011Wa2BiGZK1NdmP'', ''ses_0a9dac278ffeGqD1mzTDArbRM0'', 1783856720106, 1783856720107, ''{\"type\":\"step-start\"}''),\n-(''prt_f562568ec001eRVgUHLb37NnUj'', ''msg_f5625646b0011Wa2BiGZK1NdmP'', ''ses_0a9dac278ffeGqD1mzTDArbRM0'', 1783856720108, 1783856729771, ''{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"text\":\"Now I have all the information I need. Let me analyze the differences between the user''''s conversation-backup skill and the three referenced issues.\\n\\n1. **#27752 - opencode-mempalace-persistence**: A plugin that auto-saves conversations to a local vector database (MemPalace) in real-time. Features: auto-sync every turn, categorization, knowledge graph extraction, async mining. Uses plugin hooks (chat.message, event:session.idle).\\n\\n2. **#19017 - Save conversation history locally**: A simple feature request asking for local file-based conversation saves. Very basic request, no implementation details.\\n\\n3. **#9387 - opencode session export to markdown or json**: A feature request for a CLI command to export sessions to markdown or JSON format. Has a PR (#32262) associated. Single-session export, one-way (export only), file-based output.\\n\\nNow let me compare these with the user''''s conversation-backup skill:\\n\\n**User''''s conversation-backup skill:**\\n- Exports to SQL format (complete database dump, not just text)\\n- Bidirectional: export AND import (cross-device migration)\\n- Uses git for version control and sync (conversations-backup branch)\\n- Path/project-agnostic with placeholder substitution ({{WORKTREE}}, {{PROJECT_ID}})\\n- Cross-device via git remote URL identification\\n- Project-scoped (per-project conversations)\\n- Uses INSERT OR REPLACE for safe merging\\n- Dry-run preview before import\\n- Safety: new-session check, excludes current session from export\\n- No external dependencies (Node.js 22+ built-in sqlite)\\n- Operates on dedicated git branch to avoid polluting work branch\\n\\nKey differentiators:\\n1. **vs #27752 (MemPalace)**: MemPalace is a vector DB for semantic search/retrieval - it''''s about making conversations searchable and usable by AI. The user''''s skill is about exact-fidelity backup and cross-device migration. Different use cases entirely.\\n2. **vs #19017**: That''''s just a wish for local saves - the user''''s skill is a complete implementation with git-based sync.\\n3. **vs #9387**: Export to markdown/json is one-way, single-session, human-readable format. The user''''s skill does full SQL database dump (all tables), bidirectional (export+import), multi-session, and is designed for cross-device migration rather than human reading.\\n\\nLet me summarize the key differences and advantages.\\n\",\"time\":{\"start\":1783856720108,\"end\":1783856729770}}''),\n-(''prt_f56258eac0019AmmgS4IeGF8ye'', ''msg_f5625646b0011Wa2BiGZK1NdmP'', ''ses_0a9dac278ffeGqD1mzTDArbRM0'', 1783856729772, 1783856741326, ''{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"以下是你的 conversation-backup skill 与三个竞品的对比分析：\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 对比总结\\n\\n| 维度 | 你的 skill | #27752 MemPalace | #19017 本地保存 | #9387 导出 md/json |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **核心定位** | 跨设备对话迁移 | 向量数据库语义检索 | 纯诉求，无实现 | 单会话只读导出 |\\n| **方向** | 双向（导出+导入） | 单向（写入向量库） | 未定义 | 单向（仅导出） |\\n| **格式** | SQL 完整数据库转储 | 向量嵌入 | 未定义 | Markdown/JSON 文本 |\\n| **同步方式** | Git 版本控制 | 本地实时同步 | 未定义 | 手动 CLI 命令 |\\n| **跨设备** | 原生支持（git remote 识别） | 不支持 | 不支持 | 不支持 |\\n| **数据完整性** | 全表级（sessions/messages 等所有表） | 仅提取的知识图谱事实 | 未定义 | 单会话文本 |\\n| **路径适配** | 占位符自动替换（{{WORKTREE}}） | 无此需求 | 未定义 | 无此需求 |\\n| **安全性** | 新会话检查、排除当前会话、dry-run 预览、独立分支 | 无 | 无 | 无 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 你的核心差异化优势\\n\\n1. **唯一解决跨设备迁移问题** — 其他三个都是单设备场景，你的 skill 是唯一通过 git 实现多设备间对话完整迁移的方案\\n\\n2. **全量数据库级备份 vs 文本/向量级** — SQL 导出保留了完整的数据库结构和关系，导入后可直接恢复使用，而非仅用于人类阅读（md/json）或语义搜索（向量库）\\n\\n3. **双向闭环** — 导出+导入+dry-run 预览+确认机制，形成完整的备份恢复工作流，其他方案都是单向的\\n\\n4. **零依赖** — 利用 Node.js 22+ 内置 `node:sqlite`，无需 npm install，无外部服务依赖（MemPalace 需要额外的向量数据库）\\n\\n5. **Git 原生集成** — 对话备份跟随代码仓库一起版本管理，自带变更历史和协作能力，独立分支不污染工作区\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 建议回复维护者的差异化说明\\n\\n你可以这样回复：\\n\\n> Unlike #27752 (vector DB for semantic search), #19017 (local save wish), and #9387 (single-session text export), this skill solves a distinct problem: **cross-device conversation migration** with full database fidelity. It provides bidirectional SQL export/import via git, with path-agnostic placeholder substitution, dry-run preview, and zero external dependencies. The existing issues focus on single-device persistence or human-readable export — none address moving complete conversation state between machines.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1783856729772,\"end\":1783856741325}}''),\n-(''prt_f5625bbd0001JZq23xUwU8CHax'', ''msg_f5625646b0011Wa2BiGZK1NdmP'', ''ses_0a9dac278ffeGqD1mzTDArbRM0'', 1783856741328, 1783856741328, ''{\"reason\":\"stop\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":20742,\"input\":11118,\"output\":645,\"reasoning\":531,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":8448}},\"cost\":0.0095094}''),\n-(''prt_f56044a9800243PE06oEQk27TD'', ''msg_f56044a98001BwlDRHaUHyaiOM'', ''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'', 1783854549690, 1783854549698, ''{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"我要把这个skill开源到github，帮我取一个合适的项目名称\"}''),\n-(''prt_f5604509e001j8aQhBBAC8pRXX'', ''msg_f56044ad5001NAzc6Qd90KWIqV'', ''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'', 1783854551198, 1783854551199, ''{\"type\":\"step-start\"}''),\n-(''prt_f560450a0001lX3C2vojxUCm3h'', ''msg_f56044ad5001NAzc6Qd90KWIqV'', ''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'', 1783854551200, 1783854551997, ''{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"text\":\"The user wants to open-source a skill to GitHub and needs a suitable project name. Let me first understand what this project is about by looking at the current directory structure and files.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1783854551200,\"end\":1783854551996}}''),\n-(''prt_f560453be001VI3AJO72EA7x7w'', ''msg_f56044ad5001NAzc6Qd90KWIqV'', ''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'', 1783854551998, 1783854552690, ''{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_fdc61d22d2fe4aecbda07c5f\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"D:\\\\BaiduSyncdisk\\\\all_code\\\\candywall-skills\\\\conversation-backup\"},\"output\":\"<path>D:\\\\BaiduSyncdisk\\\\all_code\\\\candywall-skills\\\\conversation-backup</path>\\n<type>directory</type>\\n<entries>\\nscripts/\\nSKILL.md\\n\\n(2 entries)\\n</entries>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"scripts/\\nSKILL.md\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[],\"display\":{\"type\":\"directory\",\"path\":\"D:\\\\BaiduSyncdisk\\\\all_code\\\\candywall-skills\\\\conversation-backup\",\"entries\":[\"scripts/\",\"SKILL.md\"],\"offset\":1,\"totalEntries\":2,\"truncated\":false}},\"title\":\"BaiduSyncdisk\\\\all_code\\\\candywall-skills\\\\conversation-backup\",\"time\":{\"start\":1783854552686,\"end\":1783854552689}}}''),\n-(''prt_f56045674001HuGo8DstwdOrLm'', ''msg_f56044ad5001NAzc6Qd90KWIqV'', ''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'', 1783854552692, 1783854552693, ''{\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":8836,\"input\":8753,\"output\":47,\"reasoning\":36,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0.0046255}''),\n-(''prt_f56045962001L681xFDiTbmXPy'', ''msg_f5604567b001DUFI5Vj6oyMzYl'', ''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'', 1783854553442, 1783854553443, ''{\"type\":\"step-start\"}''),\n-(''prt_f56045964001thEb5YH1DGpRol'', ''msg_f5604567b001DUFI5Vj6oyMzYl'', ''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'', 1783854553444, 1783854553898, ''{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"text\":\"Let me read the SKILL.md to understand what this skill does before suggesting a name.\\n\",\"time\":{\"start\":1783854553444,\"end\":1783854553896}}''),\n-(''prt_f56045b2c001w6ejuKiqPsJMHu'', ''msg_f5604567b001DUFI5Vj6oyMzYl'', ''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'', 1783854553900, 1783854554648, ''{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_109f7c1f5ec64e25814deab7\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"D:\\\\BaiduSyncdisk\\\\all_code\\\\candywall-skills\\\\conversation-backup\\\\SKILL.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>D:\\\\BaiduSyncdisk\\\\all_code\\\\candywall-skills\\\\conversation-backup\\\\SKILL.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: ---\\n2: name: conversation-backup\\n3: description: 当用户提到\\\"对话备份\\\"时导出当前项目的 opencode 对话记录为 SQL 文件并提交推送到远程仓库；当用户提到\\\"对话导入\\\"时从 SQL 文件导入对话记录到本地 opencode 数据库。\\n4: ---\\n5: \\n6: # 对话备份与导入\\n7: \\n8: 本 skill 用于在不同设备间迁移 opencode 对话记录。对话数据导出为 SQL 文件，跟随项目代码一起通过 git 管理。\\n9: \\n10: ## 脚本路径说明\\n11: \\n12: 本 skill 的脚本位于 SKILL.md 同级 `scripts/` 目录下，执行时需使用绝对路径：\\n13: \\n14: ```\\n15: C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/\\n16: ```\\n17: \\n18: ## 前置检查（必须首先执行）\\n19: \\n20: **无论用户说\\\"对话备份\\\"还是\\\"对话导入\\\"，都必须先执行以下检查：**\\n21: \\n22: 1. 运行检查脚本：\\n23: \\n24: ```bash\\n25: node C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/check_session.js\\n26: ```\\n27: \\n28: 2. 检查输出的 JSON：\\n29:    - 如果 `is_new_session: false`：**终止流程**，告诉用户：「对话备份/导入必须在新的对话中执行，当前对话已有历史记录，请新建一个对话后再执行此操作。」\\n30:    - 如果 `is_new_session: true`：继续执行后续流程\\n31: \\n32: 3. 记录输出中的 `session_id`，后续步骤需要用到\\n33: \\n34: ## 对话备份\\n35: \\n36: 当前置检查通过后，执行以下步骤：\\n37: \\n38: 1. 记录当前分支，拉取远程变更，然后切换到 `conversations-backup` 分支：\\n39: \\n40: ```bash\\n41: ORIGINAL_BRANCH=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD)\\n42: git fetch origin\\n43: git checkout conversations-backup 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b conversations-backup origin/main\\n44: ```\\n45: \\n46: 2. 运行导出脚本，排除当前对话（将 `<项目目录>` 替换为当前项目的绝对路径，`<session_id>` 替换为前置检查中获取的当前对话 ID）：\\n47: \\n48: ```bash\\n49: node C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/export_conversations.js --exclude-session <session_id> \\\"<项目目录>\\\"\\n50: ```\\n51: \\n52: 3. 检查输出的 JSON，确认 `success: true` 并查看各表导出的记录数\\n53: 4. 使用输出中的 `commit_message` 字段作为 git commit message，**必须完整使用，不得截断或省略任何内容**（包括各对话详情列表）：\\n54: \\n55: ```bash\\n56: git add .opencode/conversations.sql\\n57: git commit -m \\\"使用 commit_message 字段的内容\\\"\\n58: git push origin conversations-backup\\n59: ```\\n60: \\n61: 5. 切回用户原来的分支：\\n62: \\n63: ```bash\\n64: git checkout $ORIGINAL_BRANCH\\n65: ```\\n66: \\n67: 6. 向用户报告导出结果（各表记录数）\\n68: \\n69: ## 对话导入\\n70: \\n71: 当前置检查通过后，执行以下步骤：\\n72: \\n73: 1. 记录当前分支，拉取远程变更，然后切换到 `conversations-backup` 分支：\\n74: \\n75: ```bash\\n76: ORIGINAL_BRANCH=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD)\\n77: git fetch origin\\n78: git checkout conversations-backup 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b conversations-backup origin/main\\n79: ```\\n80: \\n81: 2. 先运行 dry-run 预览：\\n82: \\n83: ```bash\\n84: node C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/import_conversations.js --dry-run \\\"<项目目录>\\\"\\n85: ```\\n86: \\n87: 3. 将预览结果展示给用户，包括：\\n88:    - 各表将要导入的记录数\\n89:    - 本地项目路径和 project_id\\n90:    - SQL 文件头部元信息\\n91: \\n92: 4. 使用 `question` 工具询问用户是否确认导入，说明导入将使用 `INSERT OR REPLACE` 覆盖同主键的已有记录\\n93: \\n94: 5. 用户确认后执行实际导入：\\n95: \\n96: ```bash\\n97: node C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/import_conversations.js --yes \\\"<项目目录>\\\"\\n98: ```\\n99: \\n100: 6. 切回用户原来的分支：\\n101: \\n102: ```bash\\n103: git checkout $ORIGINAL_BRANCH\\n104: ```\\n105: \\n106: 7. 向用户报告导入结果\\n107: \\n108: ## 注意事项\\n109: \\n110: - SQL 文件中的项目绝对路径和 project_id 使用 `{{WORKTREE}}` 和 `{{PROJECT_ID}}` 占位符，导入时自动替换为当前设备的实际值\\n111: - 跨设备识别通过 git remote URL 确认是同一个项目\\n112: - 导入使用 `INSERT OR REPLACE`，主键相同的记录会被覆盖，不影响其他项目的对话\\n113: - 脚本依赖 Node.js 22+（使用内置 `node:sqlite` 模块，无需 npm install）\\n114: - **对话备份/导入必须在新的对话中执行**，避免将执行过程本身的数据导出\\n115: - 备份/导入操作在独立的 `conversations-backup` 分支上执行，避免 commit 记录污染用户的工作分支；操作完成后自动切回原分支\\n\\n(End of file - total 115 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"---\\nname: conversation-backup\\ndescription: 当用户提到\\\"对话备份\\\"时导出当前项目的 opencode 对话记录为 SQL 文件并提交推送到远程仓库；当用户提到\\\"对话导入\\\"时从 SQL 文件导入对话记录到本地 opencode 数据库。\\n---\\n\\n# 对话备份与导入\\n\\n本 skill 用于在不同设备间迁移 opencode 对话记录。对话数据导出为 SQL 文件，跟随项目代码一起通过 git 管理。\\n\\n## 脚本路径说明\\n\\n本 skill 的脚本位于 SKILL.md 同级 `scripts/` 目录下，执行时需使用绝对路径：\\n\\n```\\nC:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/\\n```\\n\\n## 前置检查（必须首先执行）\\n\\n**无论用户说\\\"对话备份\\\"还是\\\"对话导入\\\"，都必须先执行以下检查：**\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[],\"display\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"path\":\"D:\\\\BaiduSyncdisk\\\\all_code\\\\candywall-skills\\\\conversation-backup\\\\SKILL.md\",\"text\":\"---\\nname: conversation-backup\\ndescription: 当用户提到\\\"对话备份\\\"时导出当前项目的 opencode 对话记录为 SQL 文件并提交推送到远程仓库；当用户提到\\\"对话导入\\\"时从 SQL 文件导入对话记录到本地 opencode 数据库。\\n---\\n\\n# 对话备份与导入\\n\\n本 skill 用于在不同设备间迁移 opencode 对话记录。对话数据导出为 SQL 文件，跟随项目代码一起通过 git 管理。\\n\\n## 脚本路径说明\\n\\n本 skill 的脚本位于 SKILL.md 同级 `scripts/` 目录下，执行时需使用绝对路径：\\n\\n```\\nC:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/\\n```\\n\\n## 前置检查（必须首先执行）\\n\\n**无论用户说\\\"对话备份\\\"还是\\\"对话导入\\\"，都必须先执行以下检查：**\\n\\n1. 运行检查脚本：\\n\\n```bash\\nnode C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/check_session.js\\n```\\n\\n2. 检查输出的 JSON：\\n   - 如果 `is_new_session: false`：**终止流程**，告诉用户：「对话备份/导入必须在新的对话中执行，当前对话已有历史记录，请新建一个对话后再执行此操作。」\\n   - 如果 `is_new_session: true`：继续执行后续流程\\n\\n3. 记录输出中的 `session_id`，后续步骤需要用到\\n\\n## 对话备份\\n\\n当前置检查通过后，执行以下步骤：\\n\\n1. 记录当前分支，拉取远程变更，然后切换到 `conversations-backup` 分支：\\n\\n```bash\\nORIGINAL_BRANCH=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD)\\ngit fetch origin\\ngit checkout conversations-backup 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b conversations-backup origin/main\\n```\\n\\n2. 运行导出脚本，排除当前对话（将 `<项目目录>` 替换为当前项目的绝对路径，`<session_id>` 替换为前置检查中获取的当前对话 ID）：\\n\\n```bash\\nnode C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/export_conversations.js --exclude-session <session_id> \\\"<项目目录>\\\"\\n```\\n\\n3. 检查输出的 JSON，确认 `success: true` 并查看各表导出的记录数\\n4. 使用输出中的 `commit_message` 字段作为 git commit message，**必须完整使用，不得截断或省略任何内容**（包括各对话详情列表）：\\n\\n```bash\\ngit add .opencode/conversations.sql\\ngit commit -m \\\"使用 commit_message 字段的内容\\\"\\ngit push origin conversations-backup\\n```\\n\\n5. 切回用户原来的分支：\\n\\n```bash\\ngit checkout $ORIGINAL_BRANCH\\n```\\n\\n6. 向用户报告导出结果（各表记录数）\\n\\n## 对话导入\\n\\n当前置检查通过后，执行以下步骤：\\n\\n1. 记录当前分支，拉取远程变更，然后切换到 `conversations-backup` 分支：\\n\\n```bash\\nORIGINAL_BRANCH=$(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD)\\ngit fetch origin\\ngit checkout conversations-backup 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b conversations-backup origin/main\\n```\\n\\n2. 先运行 dry-run 预览：\\n\\n```bash\\nnode C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/import_conversations.js --dry-run \\\"<项目目录>\\\"\\n```\\n\\n3. 将预览结果展示给用户，包括：\\n   - 各表将要导入的记录数\\n   - 本地项目路径和 project_id\\n   - SQL 文件头部元信息\\n\\n4. 使用 `question` 工具询问用户是否确认导入，说明导入将使用 `INSERT OR REPLACE` 覆盖同主键的已有记录\\n\\n5. 用户确认后执行实际导入：\\n\\n```bash\\nnode C:/Users/Administrator/.claude/skills/conversation-backup/scripts/import_conversations.js --yes \\\"<项目目录>\\\"\\n```\\n\\n6. 切回用户原来的分支：\\n\\n```bash\\ngit checkout $ORIGINAL_BRANCH\\n```\\n\\n7. 向用户报告导入结果\\n\\n## 注意事项\\n\\n- SQL 文件中的项目绝对路径和 project_id 使用 `{{WORKTREE}}` 和 `{{PROJECT_ID}}` 占位符，导入时自动替换为当前设备的实际值\\n- 跨设备识别通过 git remote URL 确认是同一个项目\\n- 导入使用 `INSERT OR REPLACE`，主键相同的记录会被覆盖，不影响其他项目的对话\\n- 脚本依赖 Node.js 22+（使用内置 `node:sqlite` 模块，无需 npm install）\\n- **对话备份/导入必须在新的对话中执行**，避免将执行过程本身的数据导出\\n- 备份/导入操作在独立的 `conversations-backup` 分支上执行，避免 commit 记录污染用户的工作分支；操作完成后自动切回原分支\",\"lineStart\":1,\"lineEnd\":115,\"totalLines\":115,\"truncated\":false}},\"title\":\"BaiduSyncdisk\\\\all_code\\\\candywall-skills\\\\conversation-backup\\\\SKILL.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1783854554630,\"end\":1783854554648}}}''),\n-(''prt_f56045e1a001LKWVaqG0LA6AuD'', ''msg_f5604567b001DUFI5Vj6oyMzYl'', ''ses_0a9fbb56effeQaZdXvhiM6xltc'', 1783854554