('prt_f9ee61ba1001AY1O2woGviMaNY', 'msg_f9ee6121f001MrUabFXXdnar9d', 'ses_061261d62ffejBZXAQWueu5kOe', 1785077308321, 1785077358522, '{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now I understand the situation clearly:\n\n1. `1948cad` - Initial commit with the skill files (SKILL.md, scripts/*)\n2. `a65c823` - Added README docs\n3. `c35fcd1` - Added language switch links\n4. `4da2a87` - Added skill directory description\n5. `34b164a` - Added MIT license\n6. `042853b` - Export conversations (data)\n7. `81c5274` - Export conversations (data)\n8. `ab630e8` - Export conversations (data)\n9. `581d4ef` - Synced source project changes (SKILL.md, check_session.js, import_conversations.js)\n\nThe issue with `581d4ef`''s commit message is that it lists changes that were ALREADY part of the initial commit `1948cad` (like \"备份/导入操作切换到独立 conversations-backup 分支执行\" - this was already in the initial SKILL.md). The actual diff of `581d4ef` only shows the INCREMENTAL changes.\n\nLet me check what the initial SKILL.md already contained to understand which bullet points in `581d4ef`''s message are actually new vs already existed.\n\nFrom the diff I saw earlier:\n- The initial SKILL.md (in `1948cad`) already had: 备份/导入操作切换到独立分支, commit_message 不得截断, push -u (wait, did it?)\n\nLet me look at the diff again more carefully.\n\nFrom the diff of `581d4ef`:\n1. description line: added 批量备份/导入 triggers - NEW\n2. `git fetch origin` → `git fetch origin conversations-backup` - NEW change\n3. Added 预导入检查 step (step 2) - NEW\n4. `git push origin` → `git push -u origin` - NEW change\n5. Added 批量对话备份 section - NEW\n6. Added 批量对话导入 section - NEW\n\nSo the actual changes in `581d4ef` are:\n- SKILL.md: 新增批量备份/导入模式描述、预导入检查步骤、git fetch 改为只拉取目标分支、push 添加 -u 参数\n- check_session.js: 按 project_id 过滤会话、无会话时正常退出\n- import_conversations.js: 新增 --ignore-existing 参数、dry-run 增加 session_analysis\n\nNow, the commit message lists things like:\n- \"备份/导入操作切换到独立 conversations-backup 分支执行\" - This was ALREADY in the initial commit''s SKILL.md\n- \"优化对话备份 commit message 格式，增加摘要和总轮次统计\" - This was ALREADY in the initial commit\n- \"强调 commit_message 必须完整使用，不得截断\" - This was ALREADY in the initial commit\n- \"导出时排除已归档的对话\" - This was ALREADY in the initial commit''s export_conversations.js\n\nSo the user wants to:\n1. Remove from `581d4ef`''s message the items that were already in the initial commit\n2. Add those items to the initial commit''s message (or wherever they belong)\n\nAnd also the `main` branch has `f464cb7` which is \"fix: 备份推送命令添加 -u 参数设置上游追踪\" - this is now redundant.\n\nLet me think about what the user actually wants. They said \"整理当前项目提交历史，跟本次无关的git msg描述移到其他提交的描述中\". \n\n\"跟本次无关\" means \"unrelated to this time''s changes\". So items in `581d4ef`''s message that describe changes already present in earlier commits should be moved to those earlier commits.\n\nThe items that were already in the initial commit:\n- 备份/导入操作切换到独立 conversations-backup 分支执行 → should be in initial commit message\n- 优化对话备份 commit message 格式 → should be in initial commit message  \n- 强调 commit_message 必须完整使用 → should be in initial commit message\n- 导出时排除已归档的对话 → should be in initial commit message\n\nThe items that are actually new in `581d4ef`:\n- git fetch 改为只拉取 conversations-backup 分支\n- push 添加 -u 参数\n- 增强前置检查（按 project_id 过滤会话）、新增批量备份/导入模式和预导入功能\n- import_conversations.js 新增 --ignore-existing 参数\n\nSo I need to do an interactive rebase to:\n1. Amend `1948cad` to include the descriptions that belong to it\n2. Amend `581d4ef` to only include what it actually changed\n\nBut interactive rebase is tricky. Let me think about the approach.\n\nActually, I can''t use `git rebase -i` in this environment since it requires interactive input. But I can use `GIT_SEQUENCE_EDITOR` to script it.\n\nWait, the user said \"整理当前项目提交历史\". Let me think about which branch they mean. They''re on `conversations-backup`. The `main` branch also has `f464cb7`.\n\nLet me plan:\n\nFor `conversations-backup` branch:\n1. Amend `1948cad` (initial commit) message to include the features that were already in it\n2. Amend `581d4ef` message to only list actual changes\n\nFor `main` branch:\n- `f464cb7` \"fix: 备份推送命令添加 -u 参数设置上游追踪\" - this is now superseded by the conversations-backup branch changes\n\nActually, let me re-read the user''s request more carefully: \"整理当前项目提交历史，跟本次无关的git msg描述移到其他提交的描述中\"\n\n\"当前项目\" = current project (this repo)\n\"跟本次无关的git msg描述\" = git msg descriptions unrelated to this change\n\"移到其他提交的描述中\" = move to other commit descriptions\n\nSo the user wants me to:\n1. Identify items in `581d4ef`''s message that don''t belong there (they describe changes already in earlier commits)\n2. Move those items to the appropriate earlier commits\n\nLet me figure out which commit each item should go to:\n\nThe initial commit `1948cad` already contained ALL the skill code including:\n- 备份/导入操作切换到独立分支 (already in SKILL.md)\n- commit message 格式优化 (already in export script)\n- commit_message 不得截断 (already in SKILL.md)\n- 排除已归档对话 (already in export script)\n\nSo all 4 of these should be added to `1948cad`''s message.\n\nAnd `581d4ef` should only have:\n- git fetch 改为只拉取 conversations-backup 分支\n- push 添加 -u 参数\n- 增强前置检查、新增批量模式和预导入功能\n- import 新增 --ignore-existing 参数\n\nLet me do this with a scripted rebase. I''ll use `GIT_SEQUENCE_EDITOR` on Windows.\n\nActually, on Windows PowerShell, I need to be careful. Let me use a different approach - I can use `git filter-branch` or just do a manual rebase.\n\nActually, the simplest approach for just amending 2 commits is:\n\n1. Use `git rebase -i --root` with a scripted editor\n2. Or manually: soft reset, recommit\n\nLet me try the scripted approach. On Windows, I can create a small script file.\n\nActually, let me think about this more carefully. The commits on `conversations-backup` are:\n\n```\n581d4ef feat(conversation-backup): 同步源项目全部变更\nab630e8 【导出opencode对话记录】截止2026-07-26 22:07:49\n81c5274 【导出opencode对话记录】截止2026-07-21 20:34:51\n042853b 【导出opencode对话记录】截止2026-07-12 20:24:52\n34b164a 添加 MIT 开源协议文件\n4da2a87 添加 OpenCode 和 Claude Code 的 skill 目录说明\nc35fcd1 添加语言切换链接\na65c823 添加中英文 README 文档\n1948cad 初始提交：opencode 对话备份与同步 skill\n```\n\nI need to amend `1948cad` and `581d4ef`. Since `1948cad` is the root commit, I need `--root` flag.\n\nLet me create a script for the sequence editor.\n\nOn Windows PowerShell, I can set the environment variable and use a script.\n\nActually, let me try a simpler approach. I''ll:\n1. Create a temporary script that modifies the rebase todo\n2. Run the rebase\n\nOr even simpler: I can use `git rebase --onto` with cherry-pick and amend.\n\nLet me think of the cleanest approach...\n\nActually, the cleanest way:\n1. `git checkout -b temp` from current HEAD\n2. `git reset --hard 1948cad~` (but 1948cad is root, so I need `--root`)\n3. Cherry-pick each commit, amending as needed\n\nWait, let me just use the GIT_SEQUENCE_EDITOR approach. On Windows:\n\n```powershell\n$env:GIT_SEQUENCE_EDITOR = \"powershell -Command `\"Get-Content `$args[0] | ForEach-Object { `$_.Replace(''pick 1948cad'', ''reword 1948cad'').Replace(''pick 581d4ef'', ''reword 581d4ef'') } | Set-Content `$args[0]`\"\"\n```\n\nHmm, this is getting complicated with escaping. Let me create a script file instead.\n\nActually, let me just create a simple batch/ps1 script for the sequence editor, and another for the commit message editor. This is getting complex.\n\nLet me try a different approach - manual rebase:\n\n```\ngit checkout -b rebase-temp\n# Reset to before the first commit we want to change\ngit reset --hard 1948cad^  # This won''t work for root commit\n```\n\nFor root commit, I can use:\n```\ngit checkout --orphan temp-branch\ngit commit -m \"new message\"  # But I need the same tree as 1948cad\n```\n\nActually, the simplest approach:\n\n1. `git checkout 1948cad` (detached HEAD)\n2. `git commit --amend -m \"new message\"` \n3. `git cherry-pick a65c823 c35fcd1 4da2a87 34b164a 042853b 81c5274 ab630e8` (the middle commits, no changes needed)\n4. `git cherry-pick 581d4ef` then amend\n\nWait, but 1948cad is the root. Let me check:\n\n```\ngit log --oneline 1948cad\n```\n\nIt should show just one commit. So I can checkout it, amend, then cherry-pick the rest.\n\nLet me do this step by step.\n\nActually, I realize I need to be more careful. Let me first figure out exactly what the new messages should be.\n\nFor `1948cad` (initial commit), the new message should include:\n- 初始提交：opencode 对话备份与同步 skill\n- 备份/导入操作切换到独立 conversations-backup 分支执行，避免污染工作分支\n- 优化对话备份 commit message 格式，增加摘要和总轮次统计\n- 强调 commit_message 必须完整使用，不得截断\n- 导出时排除已归档的对话\n\nFor `581d4ef`, the new message should only include what was actually changed:\n- git fetch 改为只拉取 conversations-backup 分支而非全部分支\n- push 添加 -u 参数设置上游追踪\n- 增强前置检查（按 project_id 过滤会话）、新增批量备份/导入模式和预导入功能\n- import_conversations.js 新增 --ignore-existing 参数，dry-run 增加 session_analysis 统计\n\nOK let me proceed with the manual approach.\n","time":{"start":1785077308321,"end":1785077358521}}'),
